1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,129
This is RoamIQ.

2
00:00:01,179 --> 00:00:03,879
It plans trips from live search data,

3
00:00:03,929 --> 00:00:06,236
not from a language model's memory.

4
00:00:06,286 --> 00:00:08,593
Every price and every place you

5
00:00:08,643 --> 00:00:10,950
are about to see is real.

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,172
Seven SerpApi engines power it.

7
00:00:13,222 --> 00:00:15,839
Google Flights, Hotels, Maps Directions, Local,

8
00:00:15,889 --> 00:00:18,506
News, Travel Explore, and Maps geocoding.

9
00:00:18,556 --> 00:00:20,728
The model never invents a

10
00:00:20,778 --> 00:00:22,950
price or a place name.

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,150
Mumbai to Goa.

12
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,950
Five days in November, mid range budget,

13
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,750
interests set to beaches, food and heritage.

14
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:31,750
Budget is not cosmetic here.

15
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:34,950
It changes how flights and hotels are ranked.

16
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,402
Watch the order.

17
00:00:36,452 --> 00:00:38,337
Real data lands first.

18
00:00:38,387 --> 00:00:41,240
The globe, the route, the flights.

19
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:44,627
Only then does the model start writing.

20
00:00:44,677 --> 00:00:47,531
It is describing facts that were

21
00:00:47,581 --> 00:00:49,950
already verified, not generating them.

22
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,164
Scrolling down, live fares on the left and live

23
00:00:53,214 --> 00:00:56,379
hotel rates on the right, at the same time.

24
00:00:56,429 --> 00:00:59,236
IndiGo, thirteen thousand three hundred and thirty rupees,

25
00:00:59,286 --> 00:01:01,736
non stop, forty three kilograms of carbon.

26
00:01:01,786 --> 00:01:04,950
Rosetum Anjuna, two thousand and twenty eight a night.

27
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,580
The sidebar keeps going.

28
00:01:06,630 --> 00:01:09,431
Real restaurants from Google Local with ratings

29
00:01:09,481 --> 00:01:12,283
and price bands, then recent Goa news

30
00:01:12,333 --> 00:01:14,320
as a pre trip advisory.

31
00:01:14,370 --> 00:01:15,950
Four sources, all live.

32
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,386
Here is what matters.

33
00:01:17,436 --> 00:01:19,540
Where you sleep anchors every route.

34
00:01:19,590 --> 00:01:22,412
Pick a different hotel and the whole trip

35
00:01:22,462 --> 00:01:24,924
re clusters instantly, with no API call.

36
00:01:24,974 --> 00:01:27,078
Staying somewhere we did not suggest?

37
00:01:27,128 --> 00:01:29,950
Check in and it uses your real coordinates.

38
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,724
Days are grouped by geography

39
00:01:31,774 --> 00:01:33,498
before the model sees them.

40
00:01:33,548 --> 00:01:35,273
Distances use the Haversine formula.

41
00:01:35,323 --> 00:01:36,692
Clustering is capacitated greedy.

42
00:01:36,742 --> 00:01:39,531
Seed each day with the furthest place, pull

43
00:01:39,581 --> 00:01:42,369
in its nearest neighbours, and stop when the

44
00:01:42,419 --> 00:01:44,853
next one is over twelve kilometres away.

45
00:01:44,903 --> 00:01:46,982
Within a day, nearest neighbour ordering,

46
00:01:47,032 --> 00:01:48,756
a greedy travelling salesman approximation.

47
00:01:48,806 --> 00:01:51,950
K means gives unbalanced days, so I rejected it.

48
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,150
Old Goa comes in at a six hundred

49
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:58,350
metre spread, so it earns a Walkable badge.

50
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:01,950
Drag any stop and every distance recomputes on drop.

51
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,950
Pure arithmetic, no network call.

52
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,321
Approve to save it.

53
00:02:05,371 --> 00:02:08,407
Get directions opens real Google Maps turn by turn.

54
00:02:08,457 --> 00:02:10,464
I am here, then Done, next

55
00:02:10,514 --> 00:02:12,521
stop, and it is struck off.

56
00:02:12,571 --> 00:02:14,236
The trip completes itself when

57
00:02:14,286 --> 00:02:15,950
the last stop is checked.

58
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,187
Every plan lands in history.

59
00:02:18,237 --> 00:02:21,766
Filter by status, sort five ways, heart the

60
00:02:21,816 --> 00:02:24,897
ones you loved and show favourites only.

61
00:02:24,947 --> 00:02:28,029
Cancel, and it asks why, then keeps

62
00:02:28,079 --> 00:02:30,713
the trip with the reason attached.

63
00:02:30,763 --> 00:02:32,950
That is the accountability trail.

64
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:35,120
Share it as a QR code.

65
00:02:35,170 --> 00:02:38,376
The whole plan compresses into a six hundred character

66
00:02:38,426 --> 00:02:41,631
URL, so there is no database and no server.

67
00:02:41,681 --> 00:02:44,524
Your friend scans it, and because they re

68
00:02:44,574 --> 00:02:47,418
anchor on their own hotel, they get a

69
00:02:47,468 --> 00:02:49,950
completely different route from the same places.
